      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "{name} 선수가 고른 작은 영화관.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "A small theater {name} picked out.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2addab5d-30d4-58f4-9042-3fc7e6f345e0",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "이 영화 꼭 같이 보고 싶었어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I really wanted to watch this movie with you.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1fbdcb6d-8c56-5dc6-bd34-62e82b5ded7e",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "영화가 끝나고 한참 말이 없다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "After the movie, neither of you says anything for a while.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "29fb05bb-ac05-541b-9ee6-3bbfb2dcff70",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "외출 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "8cb36831-655e-52c4-b8da-f6a9e932f043"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "5ceafda2-5e8a-544c-8e5e-413367bcd3fc": "outing",
        "810c1482-9fd3-5d06-bfdf-e414590f9b62": -1,
        "6f5e79e6-f5d3-5ba5-92c4-7202a5340c9c": 3,
        "441d785a-0f52-5bd6-90b6-897ed15b15b0": "",
        "6558101a-d7aa-5d3e-8aaf-f75a1222d158": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a0e6820c-f673-5b7f-a66a-7eca7dc343b9",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "5436aa15-753d-5d21-9c6c-72bb3863a444",
          "text": "좋은 영화였다.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "92977d51-aec7-5698-8895-1da7fb7b47c3": "trust:+6;pmod:all:+2:-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "61a4e8c2-324c-55c5-aa19-2a2ae5e4aad5",
          "text": "너 울었지?",
          "sharedValues": {
            "92977d51-aec7-5698-8895-1da7fb7b47c3": "trust:+7;pmod:all:+2:-1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:5436aa15-753d-5d21-9c6c-72bb3863a444": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "That was a good movie.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:61a4e8c2-324c-55c5-aa19-2a2ae5e4aad5": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You cried, didn't you?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c0c7cce1-64f1-5347-9d62-f63291412968",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -90.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "그쵸? 감독님 취향일 줄 알았어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Right? I knew it'd be your kind of movie.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "89971020-ced0-5227-8451-136d7925c28a",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 170.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "아, 아니거든요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Wh-what? No, I didn't!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
